{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Butcher's Village</strong> is a psychological slasher horror game that provides a horrifying experience. Explore unsettling environments, solve intricate puzzles, and struggle to survive in a village that is at once eerily familiar and terrifyingly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>IMPORTANT NOTE: The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal imaging and subtle environment details. Be mindful that it is a difficult game in unconventional ways.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.poster.avif?t=1772822428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.webm?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.mp4?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/1c246e571ed13b65b8ac049e1ffebda2.avif?t=1772822428\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murtaza, living in North America in 2001, receives a desperate call from his friend, who says he\u2019s been in an accident on a rainy evening. He drives through heavy rain, but because of the dense fog, he gets into an accident. When he regains consciousness, his vehicle is wrecked and won\u2019t start. As he looks around, he notices an eerie village nearby, shrouded in the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, rapid visual effects, and intense imagery that may trigger seizures or other adverse reactions in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/151d70fd2d927e406c62030ea48a10f4.poster.avif?t=1772822428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/151d70fd2d927e406c62030ea48a10f4.webm?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/151d70fd2d927e406c62030ea48a10f4.mp4?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/4b7c63150a8c6f3d24a2671a18c6fa4c.avif?t=1772822428\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror:</strong>\u00a0A deeply story-focused experience, with an atmosphere that surrounds you in tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong>\u00a0Walking simulator emphasizing exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong> An aesthetic inspired by the early 2000s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Fear:</strong>\u00a0What looks ordinary at first slowly changes into something you can\u2019t explain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design:\u00a0</strong>Immersive audio wraps around you, raising the tension and slowly drawing you into madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong>\u00a0Solve intricate puzzles to progress and unveil mysteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a4c169d931e3a286cc68da18cda43893.poster.avif?t=1772822428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a4c169d931e3a286cc68da18cda43893.webm?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a4c169d931e3a286cc68da18cda43893.mp4?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033710?t=1772822428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/61786b6e3cf0ebe0a17feaf27700f329d46b660a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772822428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/ac8b755e2bad92265272a1d0b77f7682f15b72a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772822428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/ac8b755e2bad92265272a1d0b77f7682f15b72a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772822428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence that may negatively affect the viewer\u2019s psychological state. Some content may be inappropriate for certain age groups. It is advised to apply suitable age restrictions for the intended audience."},"demos":[{"appid":4052660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Butcher's Village</strong> is a psychological slasher horror game that provides a horrifying experience. Explore unsettling environments, solve intricate puzzles, and struggle to survive in a village that is at once eerily familiar and terrifyingly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>IMPORTANT NOTE: The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal imaging and subtle environment details. Be mindful that it is a difficult game in unconventional ways.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.poster.avif?t=1772822428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.webm?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/d7dc97026a1545860682125d795ab6bb.mp4?t=1772822428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/1c246e571ed13b65b8ac049e1ffebda2.avif?t=1772822428\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murtaza, living in North America in 2001, receives a desperate call from his friend, who says he\u2019s been in an accident on a rainy evening. He drives through heavy rain, but because of the dense fog, he gets into an accident. When he regains consciousness, his vehicle is wrecked and won\u2019t start. As he looks around, he notices an eerie village nearby, shrouded in the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra